builds do not depend on a missing Git submodule checkout. The parent revision
recorded this tree as Gitlink `4bd24bf5374053fbab070f61ee7ae2addcf589bc`.
That Gitlink did not include a `.gitmodules` entry or remote configuration.

The imported module declares `github.com/Andrew05213/applemusic_downloader` in
