`https://github.com/Andrew05213/applemusic_downloader.git` as its origin. This
is the reproducible source reference retained for this import; it is not a
claim that the parent repository owns every file in the imported tree.

The bundled README attributes the original script to Sorrow and identifies the
Wrapper project as <https://github.com/zhaarey/wrapper>. Preserve these
attributions whenever the corresponding material is redistributed.

